<title>INDIA: POLL-India TISCO 6-mth net seen down.</title>
<headline>POLL-India TISCO 6-mth net seen down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd's (TISCO) net profit is projected to drop 1.6 percent to 2.48 billion rupees in the first half of 1997/98 (April-March), according to consensus estimate in a Reuter poll on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sales are seen rising 0.4 percent to 30.3 billion rupees from 30.2 billion in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>TISCO is India's largest private steel maker.</p>
<p>Following are the details of the poll compared with actuals for the first half of 1996/97.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				NET PROFIT		   SALES</p>
<p>				   (first half to September 30)</p>
<p>			    97/98     96/97	97/98	96/97</p>
<p>					 (in millions of rupees)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>TISCO   ----PAT seen off 1.6%, sales up 0.4%</p>
<p>Average		2,482.56  2,522.20    30,322.14  30,212.90</p>
<p>High		   3,000.00		  37,500.00</p>
<p>Low		    2,065.00		  26,056.00</p>
